<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Hi&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">I’m writing to invite you to partner with the American Red
Cross through our <a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/key/humankind.html">Humankind</a>
campaign. <span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Humankind is a nationwide
movement that’s touching college campuses across the U.S. and highlights the
legacies students create as blood donors. Students are being called on to leave
their mark on humankind by hosting blood drives and giving blood. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Will you join the <b>Humankind
</b>movement by hosting a blood drive program<b> </b>on your campus? Hosting
blood drives is a valuable leadership experience and an opportunity for you to
partner </span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:
Calibri;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri">with one of
the world’s largest humanitarian organizations and most recognized brands in
the world. You can use this experience to enhance your education </span><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">and your resume. Most importantly, you will
directly impact hospital patients who are relying on donors to give blood. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">Partnering with the
Red Cross for a lifesaving blood drive program can help bring students, faculty
and the community together to help change someone’s life with every single
donation you collect.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">I hope you’ll join
us and make your mark on humankind. Contact me and let’s save lives together.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">Sincerely,</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Akzidenz-Grotesk Std Regular&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[NAME]</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p><br></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Arial">P.S. Are you involved
in other student organizations that might be interested? If so, please forward
this email or <a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Want%20to%20do%20something%20good%20and%20help%20hospital%20patients%3F%20Host%20A%20Humankind%20Blood%20Drive%20with%20the%20American%20Red%20Cross.%20Learn%20more%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.redcrossblood.org%2Fhosting-a-blood-drive%2Fkey%2Fhumankind.html%20%23Humankind%0D%0A">Tweet
this message</a> and encourage others to get involved!<o:p></o:p></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
